          "page": 1,
          "section": "Abstract",
          "quote": "This work primarily investigated the influences of heat treatment at different temperatures (600 ℃ , 700 ℃ , 800 ℃ , and 900 ℃ ) after holding at 1 h, 2 h, 4 h, and 10 h respectively on the mechanical behavior and micro - structure of the Ni 30 Co 30 Cr 10 Fe 10 Al 18 W 2 eutectic high-entropy alloy, which is characterized by a dual-phase microstructure composed of B2 (NiAl) and FCC (CoCrFeW-rich) phases, were investigated.",
